{% block title%}Halloween {{ year }}!{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
    <p>
        This year, Halloween is particularly spooky!
    </p>
    <p>
        With a bit of luck, you'll find something in the desert that you can use to give your fellow citizens a proper fright!
    </p>

    <p>
        During the event, you can also store souls in your house to protect it from burglars. But
        could sleeping next to the soul of a dead person at night have its drawbacks...?
    </p>
    <p>
        And if the daily struggle for survival against the undead hordes isn't scary enough for you,
        why not decorate your house with pumpkins!
    </p>

    <p>
        <b>This year's halloween event</b> will last from
        {{ date_begin|format_datetime('medium', 'none', '', null, 'gregorian', 'de') }} until
        {{ date_end|format_datetime('medium', 'none', '', null, 'gregorian', 'de') }}!
    </p>
{% endblock %}